                "title": "Rope Leverset, Baldwin 5104",
                "description": "Baldwin Estate 5104 Lever With 5004 Rosette - A great way to add ornate touches to your home is to change out the door levers. This Baldwin made 5104 Rope Leverset adds just enough decorative detail without looking gaudy. Constructed out of solid brass, it fits 2-1/8 inch standard door preparation. This leverset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "BAL-5104, Baldwin rope leversets, baldwin 5104 levers, baldwin 5048 roses, baldwin 5004 roses, solid brass leversets, rope levers, ornate levesets, baldwin 5104 leversets, baldwin 5004 rosettes, baldwin estates collections, baldwin 5149 rose,  ada compliant levers, Solid Brass Baldwin Rope Levers,"
